Chapter: PlugIndirect
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Deep recursion that goes through a FUNCTION VALUE at every level, so each frame
 carries a call_indirect rather than a direct call. `deeprec` is the direct
 shape and V8 handles its overflow as a clean trap; this asks whether the
 indirect one is handled the same way.

 We say:

Section: Entry

  bump : Integer -> Integer
  bump (n) = n + 1

  chain : (Integer -> Integer), Integer -> Integer
  chain (f) (n) = if n <= 0 then 0 else f (chain f (n - 1))

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("chain 1000  = " & show (chain bump 1000))
    print-line-uni ("chain 20000 = " & show (chain bump 20000))
    print-line-uni ("chain 200000 = " & show (chain bump 200000))
  end
